French word lists
-----------------

Sparkle's French word lists (game/words/fr.json) are made by tools/build_words.py from two sources,
and are available under the terms of both of their licences:

* The words, and every form of them, come from Grammalecte's French spelling dictionary
  ("Dictionnaires orthographiques français", version 7.5), by Olivier R. and its contributors,
  https://grammalecte.net/, as packaged in https://github.com/wooorm/dictionaries
  (dictionaries/fr). It is licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0:
  https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/. Its source is at the addresses above.

* Which words are common enough to be the secret word comes from FrequencyWords by Hermit Dave,
  https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords (content/2018/fr/fr_50k.txt), made from the
  OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus. FrequencyWords' content is licensed under the Creative Commons
  Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 licence: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/.

Sparkle's changes: words are written without accents, names and the words in tools/words/fr/ are
left out, and the secret words are put in a fixed shuffled order.
